          PUSH B         ; Save Disk/User
          < move around on disks/users >
          POP  B         ; Get Disk/User
          CALL LOGUD     ; Log into Disk/User


     GUÁ  anä SUÁ arå tï bå useä tï finä ouô whaô useò  areá 
thå  prograí  ió iî (GUA© anä tï enteò á specifiã useò  areá 
(SUA).

     For example:

          CALL GUA       ; Find out current user
          PUSH PSW       ; Save it
          < move around on other user areas>
          POP  PSW       ; Get current user
          CALL SUA       ; Log into User

     GUÁ  anä  SUÁ  arå  usefuì  iî  conjunctioî  witè   thå 
automatiã disë logginç featurå oæ CP/M¬ wherå thå firsô bytå 
oæ thå FCÂ indicateó á disë tï autoloç intï (1=A¬ 2=B¬ etc.¬ 
